PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Graph Side (Left)
    - Duty chain v0 → v1 → v2 → v3
  L2: Manifold Side (Right)
    - Manifold patch with spectral contours (from F5)
  L3: Operator Arrow
    - Large arrow labeled "𝒮"
    - 8px stroke, bright blue (#00A0FFFF)
  L4: Mapping Visualization
    - Each v_i mapped to a point p_i on manifold
    - p_i labeled with Δ(ι(v_i))
  L5: Labels
    - "Spectral-Duty Operator"
    - "𝒮(v) = Δ(ι(v))"
  L6: Annotation Overlay
    - Text: "Discrete → Spectral Geometry"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
